# Summons the snake's visible body at the ravager: head (seg0), seven body segments, the tail (seg8). mob/boss/ravenous_snake/tick
# keeps them following each other every tick, so the body slithers after the head. Each part is turned 180 degrees
# (left_rotation) because an item display shows a model's back as its front. The head and the first two segments sit
# higher, so it rears up like the anime's snake.
summon minecraft:item_display ~ ~ ~ {Tags:["slf.snake_part","slf.seg0"],teleport_duration:2,item_display:"none",item:{id:"minecraft:paper",count:1,components:{"minecraft:item_model":"slf:ravenous_snake_head"}},transformation:{left_rotation:[0f,1f,0f,0f],right_rotation:[0f,0f,0f,1f],translation:[0f,2.3f,0f],scale:[2.6f,2.6f,2.6f]}}
